  {"id": "file:packages/deliverables/deliverable-file-references/src/index.ts", "type": "file", "name": "index.ts", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/deliverable-file-references/src/index.ts", "summary": "函数插件 deliverable-file-references：向 systemPrompt 注册静态 ui:deliverable-file-references 节，指导模型在最终回复中内联展示主要结果、对已有文件一律用全路径链接（含 #L 行号后缀）并用 present 发布完整交付物。", "tags": ["plugin", "system-prompt", "file-references", "guidance"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/deliverable-file-references/src/index.ts:apply", "type": "function", "name": "apply", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/deliverable-file-references/src/index.ts", "lineRange": [24, 30], "summary": "把 FILE_REFERENCE_PROMPT 以 DELIVERABLE_FILE_REFERENCES 顺序注册进 systemPrompt registry，不挂载任何 GUI。", "tags": ["plugin-entry", "prompt-registration"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "config:packages/deliverables/deliverable-file-references/tsconfig.json", "type": "config", "name": "tsconfig.json", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/deliverable-file-references/tsconfig.json", "summary": "包级 TypeScript 配置：extends 基座、rootDir src、outDir lib/types 并引用工作区依赖。", "tags": ["configuration", "typescript", "build-system"], "complexity": "simple"},
