  {"id": "config:packages/deliverables/tool-present/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/tool-present/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-present 包清单：声明 schemastery/cordis/dsh 依赖与 ESM 导出。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest", "esm"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/deliverables/tool-present/src/index.ts", "type": "file", "name": "index.ts", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/tool-present/src/index.ts", "summary": "函数插件 tool-present：注册 present 工具让模型把既有文件声明为最终交付物；校验 open turn 与 maxFiles 上限，经 fs.lstat/stat/resolve 核实为常规文件后用 WeakMap<ToolExecution> 暂存，成功结果在 tools/result 时以 deliverables/presented Session 事件持久化（turn+callId+files）。", "tags": ["plugin", "tool-registration", "deliverables", "session-event"], "complexity": "complex", "languageNotes": "pending WeakMap 以 ToolExecution 为键把 execute 与 tools/result 监听配对，失败结果不落事件；工具描述明言 host 可能在回合结束后才展示卡片。"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/tool-present/src/index.ts:apply", "type": "function", "name": "apply", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/tool-present/src/index.ts", "lineRange": [33, 110], "summary": "校验 maxFiles 正整数后 defineTool 注册 present（参数 schema：files 数组 path+description，输出 schema：turn+files），execute 内走 turnBoundaryOf/workingDirectory.ensure/fs 三重校验；再挂 tools/result 监听把成功交付 append 进所属 Session。", "tags": ["plugin-entry", "tool-schema", "validation", "event-emission"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "file:packages/deliverables/tool-present/src/types.ts", "type": "file", "name": "types.ts", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/tool-present/src/types.ts", "summary": "类型定义：PresentedFile（path+可选 description）与 SessionEventMap 声明合并新增 deliverables/presented 事件载荷。", "tags": ["type-definition", "session-event", "declaration-merging"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "config:packages/deliverables/tool-present/tsconfig.json", "type": "config", "name": "tsconfig.json", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/tool-present/tsconfig.json", "summary": "包级 TypeScript 配置：extends 基座、rootDir src、outDir lib/types 并引用工作区依赖。", "tags": ["configuration", "typescript", "build-system"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "document:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/README.md", "summary": "dsh-workspace-changes 包 README：每回合工作区变更摘要的用法、实现要点、模型体验（KV cache 影响）与已知限制。", "tags": ["documentation", "workspace-changes", "model-experience"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "config:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-workspace-changes 包清单：声明 diff/schemastery/cordis 及 dsh 工作区依赖与 ESM 导出。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest", "esm"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/capture.ts", "type": "file", "name": "capture.ts", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/capture.ts", "summary": "文件工具编辑点的整文件捕获：回合首次改动某路径前与回合结束各存一份按 SHA-1 内容寻址的副本（上限 maxBytes+1 读防超限放大内存），absent/oversized/file 三态 Capture 让两侧比较不依赖 git。", "tags": ["content-addressed", "file-capture", "turn-recording"], "complexity": "moderate", "languageNotes": "8000 字节内探测 NUL 判二进制（同 git 口径）；wx flag 使同内容多路径/多回合共享一份副本。"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/capture.ts:captureFile", "type": "function", "name": "captureFile", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/capture.ts", "lineRange": [38, 70], "summary": "读至多 maxBytes+1 字节：超限返回 oversized，缺失返回 absent，常规文件写入以 SHA-1 命名的副本目录并探测二进制，返回 file 态 Capture。", "tags": ["file-reading", "content-addressed", "byte-cap"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/capture.ts:sameCapture", "type": "function", "name": "sameCapture", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/capture.ts", "lineRange": [81, 84], "summary": "判断两个 Capture 是否已知内容相同：双 absent 相同、双 file 比内容哈希，oversized 永不判定相同。", "tags": ["comparison", "capture-semantics"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/compare.ts", "type": "file", "name": "compare.ts", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/compare.ts", "summary": "两份整文件文本的行级比较：structuredPatch 生成 3 行上下文的 unified diff hunk，超过 diffTimeoutMs 降级为整文件替换（coarse），并统计 added/deleted 行数。", "tags": ["diff", "timeout-degradation", "comparison"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/compare.ts:compareText", "type": "function", "name": "compareText", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/compare.ts", "lineRange": [38, 66], "summary": "对 before/after（null 表示文件不存在）做行比较：超时未出 patch 则构造单一全删全增 hunk 并标 coarse，否则映射 patch.hunks；累加 +/- 行计数。", "tags": ["line-diff", "coarse-fallback", "counting"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "file:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/git.ts", "type": "file", "name": "git.ts", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/git.ts", "summary": "经 subprocess 能力执行 git：GitRunner 以清洗环境（GIT_CONFIG_COUNT=0/GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0）、超时与输出上限跑命令；locateGitWorkspace 定位仓库并建私有对象库（GIT_OBJECT_DIRECTORY+alternates 只读挂主库），snapshotTree 用临时 index 写完整工作树快照，另有 treeBlob/blobText/diffTrees(-r -M --numstat)/gitlinkPaths/check-ignore 等只读查询。", "tags": ["git", "subprocess", "snapshot", "worktree-diff"], "complexity": "complex", "languageNotes": "私有对象库以 alternate 只读挂仓库 store，快照永不污染仓库 index/refs；exclude pathspec 排除落在工作树内的临时目录。"},
  {"id": "class:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/git.ts:GitRunner", "type": "class", "name": "GitRunner", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/git.ts", "lineRange": [41, 81], "summary": "封装单个 git 可执行文件的运行器：spawn 时不经 shell、stdout/stderr 各自限字节、AbortSignal.any 合并外部取消与超时、graceMs 2s；非零退出作为结果返回而非异常，超时/中止才抛错。", "tags": ["subprocess", "git-runner", "timeout", "output-cap"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/git.ts:locateGitWorkspace", "type": "function", "name": "locateGitWorkspace", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/git.ts", "lineRange": [127, 141], "summary": "rev-parse 定位仓库 root/gitDir/objects，建私有 objects 目录并以 GIT_ALTERNATE_OBJECT_DIRECTORIES 只读挂主库；私有目录若在工作树内则记入 excludes；非仓库返回 null。", "tags": ["git", "workspace-location", "alternates"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/git.ts:snapshotTree", "type": "function", "name": "snapshotTree", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/git.ts", "lineRange": [154, 172], "summary": "在临时 index（从仓库 index 拷贝种子，缺失容忍）上 git add --all --ignore-errors 后 write-tree，产出含未跟踪/已改但不含 ignored 的完整快照树；不触碰仓库自身 index/对象库/ref。", "tags": ["git", "snapshot", "private-index"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/git.ts:treeBlob", "type": "function", "name": "treeBlob", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/git.ts", "lineRange": [190, 201], "summary": "ls-tree 查快照树某路径的 blob（GIT_LITERAL_PATHSPECS 防文件名通配符误匹配），返回 oid 与字节数；gitlink/tree 返回 null。", "tags": ["git", "ls-tree", "pathspec-safety"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/git.ts:blobText", "type": "function", "name": "blobText", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/git.ts", "lineRange": [212, 219], "summary": "cat-file 按 maxBytes 上限读 blob 文本，截断即抛错（调用方已先用 treeBlob 核过大小）。", "tags": ["git", "blob-reading", "byte-cap"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/git.ts:diffTrees", "type": "function", "name": "diffTrees", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/git.ts", "lineRange": [231, 240], "summary": "对前后两棵快照树跑 diff-tree -r -M -z --numstat 并交给 parseNumstat；同树直接返回空，输出超上限抛错。", "tags": ["git", "numstat", "rename-detection"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/git.ts:gitlinkPaths", "type": "function", "name": "gitlinkPaths", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/git.ts", "lineRange": [251, 258], "summary": "ls-files --stage 收集 mode 160000 的 gitlink 路径（嵌套仓库与 submodule），这些目录内容永不进入摘要。", "tags": ["git", "gitlink", "submodule"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/git.ts:ignoredPaths", "type": "function", "name": "ignoredPaths", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/git.ts", "lineRange": [270, 279], "summary": "check-ignore --stdin 批量判定工作树路径是否被仓库忽略；exit 1（无一命中）返回空集，被跟踪文件不算忽略。", "tags": ["git", "check-ignore", "batch-query"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/index.ts", "type": "file", "name": "index.ts", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/index.ts", "summary": "函数插件 workspace-changes（inject subprocess/fs）：为每个有 cwd 的顶层 Session 建 TurnRecorder，监听 turn/start/end、agent/turn-stopping、tool/result，并在 fs write/edit/delete-intent 前 prepend 捕获文件工具改动；提供 workspaceChanges 服务按事件 seq 服务 summary/diff，Session disposed 时清理。git 不可用或无仓库时仅汇总文件工具编辑。", "tags": ["plugin", "turn-observation", "service-provider", "session-event"], "complexity": "complex", "languageNotes": "macOS 上 /usr/bin/git 是 Xcode stub，用 xcode-select -p 探测后才认定可用；Config 五个上界字段全正整数校验，非法值 fail load。"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/index.ts:resolveGit", "type": "function", "name": "resolveGit", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/index.ts", "lineRange": [72, 86], "summary": "经 subprocess.resolveExecutable 解析 git；darwin 上 /usr/bin/git 需 xcode-select -p 探测通过，否则视为不可用返回 null。", "tags": ["git-discovery", "macos-stub", "probe"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/index.ts:apply", "type": "function", "name": "apply", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/index.ts", "lineRange": [95, 188], "summary": "校验配置后建 recorder 注册表：ctx.effect 登记清理、provide workspaceChanges 服务、监听 session 事件与 fs 意图钩子（prepend 捕获）、tools/pre-execute 把 ToolExecution 映射到 recorder 并等待 settled，保证快照/捕获不与改动竞态。", "tags": ["plugin-entry", "event-wiring", "intent-hooks", "service-registration"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "file:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/numstat.ts", "type": "file", "name": "numstat.ts", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/numstat.ts", "summary": "解析 git diff-tree --numstat -z 的 NUL 分隔输出为 NumstatEntry（added/deleted/path/oldPath/binary），rename 记录以空 path+旧/新两段编码。", "tags": ["parsing", "git-numstat", "nul-delimited"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/numstat.ts:parseNumstat", "type": "function", "name": "parseNumstat", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/numstat.ts", "lineRange": [20, 52], "summary": "按 NUL 切分队列逐条解析：前两个 tab 分字段（文件名自带 tab 不误切）、空 path 触发 rename 双段读取、'-' 计数判 binary 并归零。", "tags": ["parsing", "record-queue", "rename"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "file:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/paths.ts", "type": "file", "name": "paths.ts", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/paths.ts", "summary": "路径分类与展示形态工具：canonicalPath 经最近存在祖先做 symlink 归一（/tmp 与 /private/tmp 同形）、temporaryRoots 枚举临时根、displayPathOf/durablePathOf 生成展示与持久化两种路径、isInside 判包含。", "tags": ["path-utility", "symlink-resolution", "display-forms"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/paths.ts:isInside", "type": "function", "name": "isInside", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/paths.ts", "lineRange": [21, 24], "summary": "用 path.relative 判 path 是否等于 root 或位于其下。", "tags": ["path-utility", "containment"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/paths.ts:temporaryRoots", "type": "function", "name": "temporaryRoots", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/paths.ts", "lineRange": [33, 40], "summary": "把 /tmp 与 os.tmpdir() 各自补上 symlink 归一形态，得到临时根全集合。", "tags": ["temporary-paths", "canonicalization"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/paths.ts:canonicalPath", "type": "function", "name": "canonicalPath", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/paths.ts", "lineRange": [49, 64], "summary": "逐级回退到最近可 realpath 的祖先再拼接缺失尾段，使经目录 symlink 创建的文件在存在前后得到同一规范拼写。", "tags": ["realpath", "missing-tail", "canonicalization"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/paths.ts:displayPathOf", "type": "function", "name": "displayPathOf", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/paths.ts", "lineRange": [84, 88], "summary": "展示路径：cwd/root 内取相对、home 内用 ~/ 前缀、其余绝对，统一斜杠分隔。", "tags": ["display-path", "home-abbreviation"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/paths.ts:durablePathOf", "type": "function", "name": "durablePathOf", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/paths.ts", "lineRange": [96, 98], "summary": "持久化 path 字段：工作目录内相对、外部绝对，供 Web 客户端打开文件。", "tags": ["durable-path", "relative-absolute"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/recorder.ts", "type": "file", "name": "recorder.ts", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/recorder.ts", "summary": "每 Session 的回合记录器：串行队列上做回合起始快照、文件工具改动前捕获、turn 停止时的 tree diff 与 capture 补集合并，追加 workspace/changes 事件并在 records Map 按事件 seq 保存 summary 与各文件两侧内容来源，diff 按需读取比较；dispose 删临时目录。", "tags": ["turn-recorder", "serialization-queue", "diff-serving"], "complexity": "complex", "languageNotes": "私有 promise chain 保证快照/捕获与工具执行不竞态（tools/pre-execute 先 await settled）；'failed' 基线使快照失败的仓库不被误当作无仓库汇总。"},
  {"id": "class:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/recorder.ts:TurnRecorder", "type": "class", "name": "TurnRecorder", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/recorder.ts", "lineRange": [107, 383], "summary": "核心记录器类：start 开回合并排基线快照、capture 在首次改动前捕获、stopping/end 双时机触发 record（回合内优先，避免 turn/end 后日志增长竞态）、summary/diff 对外按 seq 服务；record 合并 numstat 列表与捕获补集（剔除 gitlink、ignored、临时根），maxFiles 截断后 append 事件。", "tags": ["recorder", "lifecycle", "diff-assembly", "event-append"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "function:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/recorder.ts:changedFile", "type": "function", "name": "changedFile", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/recorder.ts", "lineRange": [392, 401], "summary": "把绝对路径与行计数组装成 WorkspaceChangedFile：durable path、display 路径与 binary/oversized 可选标记。", "tags": ["record-builder", "display-forms"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/types.ts", "type": "file", "name": "types.ts", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/src/types.ts", "summary": "类型定义：WorkspaceChangedFile/WorkspaceChangesSummary/WorkspaceDiffHunk/WorkspaceFileDiff 与 WorkspaceChanges 服务接口；经声明合并注册 workspace/changes Session 事件与 ctx.workspaceChanges 属性。", "tags": ["type-definition", "session-event", "service-contract", "declaration-merging"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "config:packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/tsconfig.json", "type": "config", "name": "tsconfig.json", "filePath": "packages/deliverables/workspace-changes/tsconfig.json", "summary": "包级 TypeScript 配置：extends 基座、rootDir src、outDir lib/types 并引用工作区依赖。", "tags": ["configuration", "typescript", "build-system"], "complexity": "simple"}
